{"timestamp": 1773954218988.0989, "start_timestamp": 1773954218985, "page": "pages6/myCircle/index", "request": {"url": "https://server-test.freeuuu.com/app-api/activityV2/can-sync-circle-list", "data": {"pageNum": 1, "pageSize": 10}, "method": "POST", "header": {"content-type": "application/json", "loginCode": "0c1SP6000f0e3W1583200g8fpB2SP60K", "platform": "34", "longitude": 121.397, "latitude": 31.2494, "Authorization": "Bearer d2516ebc16d044d892f2e1492c2ba3b0"}, "timeout": 120000}, "end_timestamp": 1773954219460, "response": {"data": {"code": 0, "data": {"list": [{"circleId": "2034377422016024577", "circleAvatar": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260319/31f04063a0e2a75110982bce1fd0e02208e4ba89d51761dad0af78e6122f3ef8.png", "circleName": "惬意的雪，炖每一刻。紧路。", "circleDescription": "悠渐畅", "circleCanChoose": 1, "circleMembers": 1, "circleMemberAvatars": ["https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260304/4fb481d727e607c388a6e2acdcf13e17b5351c1308d0146aaf81e18a17164067.jpg"]}, {"circleId": "2034375407491813378", "circleAvatar": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260319/a6f696077435b28525f7130a09e7094787f5c4aac6c942eebffc41b96b6b9bd8.png", "circleName": "暖傻笑娇回，", "circleDescription": "在暖心的岁月里，品尝厨房是对生活最好的回应。多擦拭忙碌的音乐，感受生活的小美好。汤如同暖的风景，柔品味才懂其中滋味。那些晨聆听路的时光，终会成为生命里的。 (keep going)", "circleCanChoose": 1, "circleMembers": 1, "circleMemberAvatars": ["https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260304/4fb481d727e607c388a6e2acdcf13e17b5351c1308d0146aaf81e18a17164067.jpg"]}, {"circleId": "2034175595498618881", "circleAvatar": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260318/ce9bcecee3ac09e97b2bb94cbc67821d7177b8987cc32540a307c949bc72c933.png", "circleName": "久", "circleDescription": "在暖时光里，写晚霞是最暖的事。林教会我暖洋洋地仰望，不负时光不负自己。用心 (be kind to yourself)修果茶，才能收获娇的结果。喜欢慢放空艺术馆的感觉，简单又自在的。悠然", "circleCanChoose": 1, "circleMembers": 1, "circleMemberAvatars": ["https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260304/4fb481d727e607c388a6e2acdcf13e17b5351c1308d0146aaf81e18a17164067.jpg"]}, {"circleId": "2034162187785125890", "circleAvatar": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260318/3bb356a19e228100bfe788095c00c50c90c1caec5546ebac928cc803ee22fdb4.png", "circleName": "选择相伴，强心安。勇途。", "circleDescription": "在滑的岁月里，吃书房是对生活最好的回应。那些常常擦楼道的时光，终会成为生命里的温暖底色。晨光的美好， (stay true t", "circleCanChoose": 1, "circleMembers": 1, "circleMemberAvatars": ["https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260304/4fb481d727e607c388a6e2acdcf13e17b5351c1308d0146aaf81e18a17164067.jpg"]}, {"circleId": "2034153584743333889", "circleAvatar": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260318/861664987ccd7f5a323208aec510adb39337a7e928add63285036ed257867131.png", "circleName": "愿", "circleDescription": "安静的毛巾如光，早躺便能照亮前 (growth mindset)行的路。用心", "circleCanChoose": 1, "circleMembers": 1, "circleMemberAvatars": ["https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260304/4fb481d727e607c388a6e2acdcf13e17b5351c1308d0146aaf81e18a17164067.jpg"]}, {"circleId": "2034148500756152321", "circleAvatar": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260318/179d455b89645fb5e2efa17d4bf605370eed824b123c2e296c3aa91196ecef2a.png", "circleName": "0318导入圈子", "circleDescription": "爱的方式", "circleCanChoose": 1, "circleMembers": 2, "circleMemberAvatars": ["https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260304/4fb481d727e607c388a6e2acdcf13e17b5351c1308d0146aaf81e18a17164067.jpg", "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/public/freeu-card/common/default-avatar.png"]}, {"circleId": "2034014837388804098", "circleAvatar": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260318/f347cbef29434bcdae522f502bc289511fd3e7ca1aaaf51d111390d0a68b904a.png", "circleName": "偏爱舒适的暖被窝的浅尝。", "circleDescription": "成长如诗，永远品味。醒坦途，决珍藏。持复盘。", "circleCanChoose": 1, "circleMembers": 1, "circleMemberAvatars": ["https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260304/4fb481d727e607c388a6e